            "title": "Introduction",
            "text": "<p>This Cookie Policy explains how Solace London uses cookies and similar technologies on solacelondon.com (the “Site”), and how you can control them. Solace London is a trading name of Solace London Limited, a company registered in England and Wales (company number 08603919) with its registered office at 21 Club Row, London, E2 7EY. It should be read together with our Privacy Policy, which explains how we handle your personal data. We use cookies in accordance with the Privacy and Electronic Communications Regulations (PECR) and the UK GDPR.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
